watermark-ensemble (WASH)

This project includes watermark and detector implementations adapted from
MarkLLM: An Open-Source Toolkit for LLM Watermarking (THU-BPM), licensed under
the Apache License, Version 2.0.
    https://github.com/THU-BPM/MarkLLM

The individual watermarking algorithms reproduced here originate from their
respective papers:
  * KGW       — Kirchenbauer et al., "A Watermark for Large Language Models"
  * DIP       — Wu et al., "DiPmark: A Stealthy, Efficient and Resilient Watermark"
  * AAR       — Aaronson, "Watermarking of Large Language Models" (Gumbel/EXP)
  * KTH / ITS — Kuditipudi et al., "Robust Distortion-free Watermarks for
                Language Models" (corresponding to MarkLLM EXP / EXPEdit)
  * Waterbag  — multi-key KGW variant

The native detectors are reproductions of the above methods and are provided so
that the effect of the WASH attack can be verified. They are not contributions
of this work.
